import React from "react";
const About = () => <div className="container py-5"><h1>About Page</h1><p>About Our Honey
For more than 42 years, we have been dedicated to producing pure, natural, and high-quality honey. Our journey began with a simple mission — to bring the true taste of nature directly to people’s homes.
Our honey is carefully collected from natural sources and processed with traditional knowledge passed down through generations. We ensure that every drop of honey maintains its natural nutrients, aroma, and authentic flavor.
We believe that honey is not just a sweetener, but a natural medicine and a healthy lifestyle choice. That is why we focus on purity, quality, and customer trust.
From forest honey to herbal-infused varieties, our products are made with great care to provide the best taste and health benefits.
For over four decades, the love and trust of our customers have been the foundation of our growth. We remain committed to delivering 100% pure honey directly from nature to your family.
🍯 Pure Honey | Natural Taste | Trusted for 42 Years</p></div>;
export default About;
